    329|  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
        330|    "1. THEME & PALETTE: Use #373757 as the primary brand color in Tailwind classes and CSS variables. Keep the background light (#F8FAFC) with pure white (#FFFFFF) container cards, sharp 1px borders (#E2E8F0), and dark slate text (#0F172A / #475569) to create a clean, modern, high-density enterprise SaaS appearance.",
        331|    "2. SIDEBAR NAVIGATION: Implement a rich, collapsable/responsive left sidebar with #1E1E38 background, displaying the Meridian Manufacturing brand mark, status indicator ('CONNECTED TO S/4HANA v2023'), current active user badge, and direct navigation links to all 9 modules with Lucide icons.",
        332|    "3. INDIAN MANUFACTURING & SAP LOCALIZATION: All monetary figures must be in INR (₹) with Indian Lakhs (₹ L) and Crores (₹ Cr) formatted numbers alongside standard decimals. Include the 7 Meridian Manufacturing plants (Chakan, Sriperumbudur, Sanand, Baddi, Jamshedpur, Hosur, Noida) and GST splits (CGST, SGST, IGST) in transaction simulators.",
        333|    "4. MULTI-CURRENCY CONVERSION: Support source transactions in USD, EUR, GBP, JPY, AED, and INR with transparent exchange rate displays (e.g., USD @ 83.45 ₹) and converted amount logging in FinSight target records.",
        334|    "5. DATA ACCURACY & LIVE SEED: Implement a rich backend seed script (backend/seed.py) providing 250+ realistic enterprise financial records across all 12 SAP domains, pre-configured 24 API endpoints, 50+ field mapping definitions, realistic reconciliation scenarios (including a few deliberate ₹ discrepancies to demo reconciliation diffs), and error logs.",
        335|    "6. AUTH & USER ROLES: Pre-seed admin@meridian.com (password: 'meridian2026') and viewer@meridian.com (password: 'meridian2026'). Implement standard JWT cookie authentication, with convenient one-click demo login buttons on the login screen.",
        336|    "7. RECHARTS COMPONENT USAGE: Build comprehensive interactive charts (Sync Latency, Throughput, Error Rate distribution, Financial Revenue vs Costs, AP/AR aging breakdown, and Plant Performance bar charts). Import Recharts cleanly according to the template rules.",
        337|    "8. COMPLETE WORKING MODULES: Ensure all 9 required modules are fully functional with interactive actions (e.g. Generate Mock SAP Records, Trigger Live API Test, Run Field Transformation Test, Execute Batch ETL Sync, Run Reconciliation Engine, Retry Dead-Letter Queue Records, and Update Monitoring Thresholds).",
        338|    "9. AUTOMATED TESTING SUPPORT: Add unambiguous kebab-case data-testid attributes to all buttons, navigation links, tabs, metric numbers, modals, and forms (e.g., data-testid='login-submit-button', data-testid='nav-sap-simulator', data-testid='run-etl-sync-btn', data-testid='reconcile-all-btn')."339|
    ],
    340|  "UNIVERSAL GUIDELINES FOR MAIN AGENT": {
